ers. Like node16 and nodenext, this mode supports package.json \\\"imports\\\" and \\\"exports\\\", but unlike the Node.js resolution modes, bundler never requires file extensions on relative paths in im\n\n[... tool result middle pruned ...]\n\n16 and nodenext, this mode supports package.json \\\"imports\\\" and \\\"exports\\\", but unlike the Node.js resolution modes, bundler never requires file extensions on relative paths in imports.\\n'classic' was used in TypeScript before the release of 1.6. classic should not be used.\"},{\"charStart\":58723,\"charEnd\":58778,\"text\":\"Requires either sourceMap or inlineSourceMap to be set.\"},{\"charStart\":60928,\"charEnd\":61040,\"text\":\"For example, using this async function in ES5 requires a await-like function and generator-like function to run:\"},{\"charStart\":95957,\"charEnd\":96035,\"text\":\"#\\nLanguage and Environment\\n#\\n Emit Decorator Metadata - \\nemitDecoratorMetadata\"},{\"charStart\":96037,\"charEnd\":96062,\"text\":\"Enables experimental supp\"}],\"sourcePath\":\"C:\\\\Temp\\\\weftmate-fact1-f015661b-84f9-4f3d-a51c-6df83ca18183\\\\profile\\\\conversations\\\\4bafd2bd0f0b22ab80911cf4c69382902c12db0dee367ffc9345785884b7ffd4\\\\session-296cad6b-0657-473a-bff9-ef5be4555ca1\\\\.weftmate-web-sources\\\\capture-0071b76a-5a62-4e5e-86c7-4259cfc1ff85.txt\"}"
